# client-billing-settings.diff-only.must-fail.patch
#
# Targets: the consolidation PUT is diff-only — an empty diff makes NO request
# (was AC-11), so a no-op save never touches the shared `clients/{id}` record.
#
# Mutates: client-billing-settings.services.ts update — drops the
# `if (diff === undefined) return {} as IClient;` short-circuit, so a no-op save
# falls through to the PUT.
#
# Expected RED (integration): client-billing-settings.replay.int.test.ts —
# the AC-21 step "saving with no change to either currency makes no request at
# all" records no such PUT, so the fall-through fires a request the scenario
# never recorded — a capture gap fails the scenario by name.
#
# Apply / verify / revert:
#   git apply <this file>
#   pnpm exec vitest run src/modules/client-billing-settings/__tests__/client-billing-settings.replay.int.test.ts   # RED
#   git apply -R <this file>
#
